Handle:

- invalid request
- invalid actor
- authorization failure
- scope violation
- security violation
- lifecycle violation
- invalid policy
- insufficient candidates
- version conflict
- repository failure
- duplicate/idempotency conflict
- consolidation failure

Do not silently swallow errors.

Retryability must be explicit.

